{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23874","headline":"劝酒十四首 何处难忘酒七首 五 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 何处难忘酒七首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处难忘酒，军功第一高。\n还乡随露布，半路授旌旄。\n玉柱剥葱手，金章烂椹袍。\n此时无一醆，何以骋雄豪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}